.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"Weapon\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Weapon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Item> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#baseDamage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Damage of one hit or one move, in the source game's hit points.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#bonusHealth> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#bonusHealth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Health granted above the maximum. Not every game allows it.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#damageInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#elementalType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#elementalType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \"elemental type\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#elementalType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#ElementalType> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#exportKey> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#exportKey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"The Ed25519 public key this game signs its passports with, as base64 of the raw 32 bytes. A receiving game verifies a passport against the key in its own copy of the issuing game's published profile, never against a key the passport carries.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#exportKey> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#fromGame> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#fromGame> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"The game whose units every number on this thing is written in.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#fromGame> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"True when every move in this game has an elemental type.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hasElementalTypes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#Game> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healAmount> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> \"Hit points restored, in the source game's hit points.\" .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#healInTarget> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\n<https://tesseractsemantics.com/ns/asset-passport/ga#hitPoints> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http:/